      "created_at": "2018-02-15T14:04:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I honestly love that these two are a canon couple. Because it's true, they're two of the heroes who have the hardest time opening up about themselves, and they're always super-serious and intense. Like, it just makes me feel good that they get on that way. :) Totally different dynamic than Captain Shootthings and the Human Marshmallow.</p>",
